From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Renato <remourato@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:14:10 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix(quick-actions): show Quick AI passively during capture,
 claim key on landing

Preview actions prepare Quick AI before capture without taking key, so the
borrowed Cmd-C keeps its target instead of resigning and dismissing the
window. The admitted capture claims key when it lands or fails in-window.
Cancel, hide, new chat, conflicting send/attach and disabled switches drop
the capture and clear its gathering notice; Replace only stays silent.
